- B-only requirements;
- duplicated requirements;
- missing requirements;
- over-compressed requirements;
- incorrectly optional requirements;
- contradictory interpretations;
- requirements that were replaced by weaker proxies.

Do not ask Opus merely to merge JSON.

Ask it to challenge extraction completeness.

